e, so its risk of losing an overflow is a bit higher.\n\n**Stock sizing.** Average demand runs about 4.6% above the forecast.\n- For product 1, running short costs 12 per unit (lost margin plus the 8 penalty), while a leftover costs 5. So holding about 10–15% extra is worthwhile.\n- For product 0, the two costs are about equal (11 each).\n\nOrder size compared with forecast demand until the next delivery:\n- Candidate 3: about 1.1.\n- Candidate 0: about 1.04 for product 0 and 1.1 for product 1.\n- Candidate 4: about 1.1 and 1.15.\n- Two-day plans: candidate 1 about 0.9 (too little), candidate 2 about 1.0, candidate 5 about 1.13 (the best of this group), candidate 6 low on product 0.\n\n**Ranking:** 3 > 4 ≈ 0 > 5 > 2 > 6 > 1 > 7. Candidates 5 and 2 are close, which is the main uncertainty in picking the top four."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4934, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4934}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T09:22:31.251Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWHPSU7jKvQBNgvxxkS5"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01LtjhWw52rCyEG2ZTvYXgzP", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWHPSijwpktCpMewGQZL", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01LtjhWw52rCyEG2ZTvYXgzP", "name": "StructuredOutput", "inp